{"id":"varadin","name":"瓦拉日丁","en":"Varaždin","country":"Croatia","lat":46.3081,"lng":16.3378,"dek":"巴洛克屋顶下的安静小城","history":"瓦拉日丁最早见于文献，与附近的温泉有关。此后它获得自由王室城镇的地位，靠着德拉瓦河平原的商路，逐渐成为克罗地亚北部的经济与军事据点。由于奥斯曼军队的袭扰，城镇围绕旧要塞布局，带有中世纪水堡的轮廓。\n\n十六至十八世纪，火灾反复光顾这座木屋密集的小城。一次大火之后，居民开始以“大火前”“大火后”来纪年；另一次复活节后的大火，几乎烧尽城内房屋与教堂。此后人们用砖石重建，强制以砖砌烟囱替换木烟囱，并组织起消防队。瓦拉日丁在灰烬里一次次站起来，反倒把城区砌成了巴洛克的样子。\n\n十八世纪中叶，克罗地亚的行政机构一度设在这里，城市迎来短暂的都城时光。一七七六年的大火烧毁大半城区，行政机构迁回萨格勒布。十九世纪，手工业与丝绸、制砖业恢复，剧院和音乐学校相继设立；二十世纪，纺织工业让它成为西北克罗地亚的工业中心。","culture":"瓦拉日丁的底色是巴洛克。耶稣会到来后，学校、教堂和宅邸沿街铺开，灰泥立面、拱窗和庭院连成一片。今天老城仍保留着这种尺度：不需要刻意寻找，步行穿过几条街，就能看到成排的巴洛克屋顶和教堂塔楼。\n\n音乐与戏剧也在这座小城扎了根。剧院和音乐学校在十九世纪先后设立，延续至今的节庆让老城在夏季格外热闹。纺织业则塑造了另一种城市记忆：从二十世纪初的纺织厂到后来的运动服装品牌，工厂与老城并置，提醒人们这里不只是明信片式的巴洛克小镇。","pull":"灰烬里砌出的巴洛克","sights":[{"name":"瓦拉日丁城堡","orig":"Stari grad Varaždin","intro":"老城西北角的旧要塞，中世纪围绕防御而建，后来成为贵族宅邸。城墙、角楼和庭院保存下来，如今是博物馆。站在堡前，能看出城镇当年以它为核心、被水与墙围合的样子。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3f/Castle_of_Varazdin_%2817%29.jpg/960px-Castle_of_Varazdin_%2817%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":556},"src":null},{"name":"瓦拉日丁主教座堂","orig":"Katedrala Uznesenja Blažene Djevice Marije","intro":"老城中心的巴洛克教堂，与耶稣会旧宅相连。立面简洁，内部以祭坛和灰泥装饰见长。它所在的广场是城市生活的焦点，教堂塔楼在街巷尽头不时出现。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/Vara%C5%BEdin_cathedral_organ.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":720},"src":null},{"name":"方济各会教堂","orig":"Franjevačka crkva sv. Ivana Krstitelja","intro":"十三世纪方济各会接管原属医院骑士团的教堂，此后数百年间不断扩建，形成早期巴洛克的面貌。教堂与修道院相邻，内部安静，与外面街道的喧闹形成对照。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f1/Franjeva%C4%8Dka_crkva_Sv._Ivana_Krstitelja_Vara%C5%BEdin.jpg/960px-Franjeva%C4%8Dka_crkva_Sv._Ivana_Krstitelja_Vara%C5%BEdin.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":775},"src":null},{"name":"瓦拉日丁市政厅","orig":"Gradska vijećnica Varaždin","intro":"老城广场上的市政厅，十六世纪由贵族寡妇贝亚特丽斯·弗兰科潘主持修建，后来多次改建。立面与广场连成一体，是巴洛克城市景观的一部分，也是当地行政的中心。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Trg_kralja_Tomislava_Varazdin2.jpg/960px-Trg_kralja_Tomislava_Varazdin2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":723},"src":null},{"name":"斯塔里格勒博物馆","orig":"Gradski muzej Varaždin","intro":"设在旧要塞内的城市博物馆，收藏涵盖历史、艺术与工艺。展陈从贵族生活到纺织工业，把这座小城几百年间的火灾、重建与日常串在一起。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Varazdin_17.jpg/960px-Varazdin_17.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":623},"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"瓦拉日丁卷心菜卷","orig":"Varaždinski sarma","intro":"用腌卷心菜叶裹肉和米饭，慢火炖煮。瓦拉日丁一带的做法偏酸，冬季常见于家庭餐桌和本地小馆，配面包和酸奶油吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/43/Postna_sarma_%28vegetarian_sarma%2C_Cuisine_of_Serbia%29.jpg/960px-Postna_sarma_%28vegetarian_sarma%2C_Cuisine_of_Serbia%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":695},"src":null},{"name":"克雷姆什尼塔","orig":"Kremšnita","intro":"夹着香草奶油与厚层奶皮的酥皮点心，源自 nearby 的萨莫博尔，但在克罗地亚北部各地都能吃到。瓦拉日丁的糕点店常做，配咖啡当下午茶。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a7/Kremna_rezina.jpg/960px-Kremna_rezina.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cremeschnitte"},{"name":"扎戈尔耶奶酪","orig":"Zagorski sir","intro":"克罗地亚扎戈尔耶地区的农家奶酪，多为白色软质，带轻微酸味。瓦拉日丁周边的市集和餐馆常以它配面包、火腿或作为沙拉的一部分。","img":null,"src":null},{"name":"普雷克穆尔卡","orig":"Prekmurska gibanica","intro":"夹有罂粟籽、核桃、苹果和奶酪的多层糕点，来自邻近的普雷克穆尔耶地区。切块厚重，甜味分层，在瓦拉日丁的甜品店也能找到。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/PrekmurskaGibanica1.JPG/960px-PrekmurskaGibanica1.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prekmurska_gibanica"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/HR-VA-Vara%C5%BEdin030.jpg/1280px-HR-VA-Vara%C5%BEdin030.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[16.2899951,46.3145716],[16.290729,46.3136349],[16.2902826,46.3117458],[16.2995964,46.3106165],[16.2986585,46.3028182],[16.3006251,46.2999998],[16.2993905,46.2959789],[16.309235,46.2908841],[16.3106807,46.2886631],[16.3108308,46.2852273],[16.3236635,46.2900398],[16.3276829,46.2884762],[16.3297039,46.2868747],[16.3312855,46.2832667],[16.3294152,46.2783043],[16.3326164,46.2750908],[16.3303113,46.2720939],[16.3299825,46.2701251],[16.3400033,46.2697033],[16.3422404,46.2705334],[16.3485696,46.2682654],[16.352366,46.2695962],[16.3618596,46.2689357],[16.3711716,46.2698105],[16.3743376,46.2709467],[16.3810252,46.2684664],[16.3644103,46.2810702],[16.365682,46.2831273],[16.3641384,46.2880145],[16.3664493,46.2883857],[16.3644577,46.2922034],[16.362474,46.292837],[16.363073,46.2980853],[16.3636583,46.2990385],[16.3651485,46.2989787],[16.3690998,46.2977958],[16.3704977,46.2999154],[16.3786237,46.3013928],[16.3860607,46.2869576],[16.3879452,46.2861343],[16.3883414,46.2870852],[16.3799949,46.3018695],[16.3808319,46.3041092],[16.3767293,46.305405],[16.3770422,46.3118397],[16.3946248,46.310539],[16.3951298,46.311407],[16.3932553,46.3170184],[16.3853433,46.3172905],[16.3829226,46.3140182],[16.3749197,46.3149152],[16.3737838,46.3134034],[16.3710846,46.3133045],[16.3674157,46.3144546],[16.3659698,46.3176433],[16.3535993,46.3251829],[16.3541649,46.3258148],[16.349546,46.3396991],[16.3356393,46.3481816],[16.3295706,46.354719],[16.328418,46.3573635],[16.3169288,46.3540369],[16.3167465,46.3517339],[16.3035071,46.3517783],[16.3050628,46.3509934],[16.3066077,46.3484236],[16.3098478,46.3470609],[16.3105345,46.3430171],[16.3133669,46.3389582],[16.317122,46.3398322],[16.3177707,46.3330402],[16.3170538,46.3319647],[16.3088593,46.3345966],[16.3056314,46.330469],[16.3015357,46.329157],[16.3017682,46.3247868],[16.2991896,46.3208136],[16.2924345,46.317007],[16.2899951,46.3145716]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"瓦拉日丁","en":"Varaždin","voyage":null}}}